{
  "$comment": [
    "Fonte única dos artefatos de deploy. Editar aqui e rodar `bun run generate:deploy`,",
    "que reescreve Dockerfile, docker-bake.hcl e .github/paths-filter.yml. O CI roda",
    "`bun run check:deploy` e falha se algum deles estiver fora de sincronia.",
    "",
    "O deploy.yml lê este arquivo em tempo de execução (scripts/release-plan.ts e",
    "scripts/release-verify.ts): `healthUrlVar` é a GitHub Variable com a URL do smoke test,",
    "`check` troca as tarefas de turbo que liberam o app (padrão: lint, typecheck e test do",
    "workspace), `release: static-site` tira o app da matriz do ECS e",
    "`buildTimeoutMinutes`/`bakeAttemptTimeoutMinutes` sobem os timeouts do build. Cada",
    "build arg vem da GitHub Variable de mesmo nome, ou da indicada em `buildArgFrom`; vazia",
    "falha o build, a não ser que esteja em `optionalBuildArgs` (scripts/release-build-env.ts).",
    "",
    "As dependências de workspace NÃO ficam aqui: o gerador as resolve do package.json",
    "de cada app, transitivamente. Era essa lista, mantida à mão em três arquivos, que",
    "vivia desatualizada — um package novo não entrava no COPY do Dockerfile (build",
    "quebrado) nem no paths-filter (app não redeployava quando o package mudava)."
  ],
  "bunImage": "oven/bun:1.4.3-alpine@sha256:629e17411f1f129dbec3af78d5af9c9f2a937435c80349437206c6b0b7422373",
  "bunRuntimeImage": "oven/bun:1.4.3-distroless@sha256:1aaa515018b0b37d95dbdebd55d1b7f37ad258a6289ba63e4bc3b9c9e3038697",
  "registryDefaults": {
    "registry": "replace-me.dkr.ecr.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com",
    "repositoryPrefix": "iefa/prod"
  },
  "apps": [
    {
      "key": "api",
      "title": "API",
      "workspace": "@iefa/api",
      "path": "apps/api",
      "kind": "bun-bundle",
      "port": 3000,
      "entry": "apps/api/dist/index.js",
      "copyPublic": true,
      "buildArgs": [],
      "notes": "o bundle da api importa @iefa/sisub-domain/gtin (utils puros de GTIN) — sem o source do package o bun build não resolve o subpath do workspace",
      "healthUrlVar": "API_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "portal",
      "title": "PORTAL",
      "workspace": "@iefa/portal",
      "path": "apps/portal",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "healthUrlVar": "IEFA_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "rumaer",
      "title": "RUMAER",
      "workspace": "@iefa/rumaer",
      "path": "apps/rumaer",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_RUMAER_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_RUMAER_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "healthUrlVar": "RUMAER_HEALTH_URL",
      "buildArgFrom": {
        "VITE_RUMAER_SUPABASE_URL": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_URL",
        "VITE_RUMAER_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "sucont",
      "title": "SUCONT (HUB SUCONT-4 — acompanhamento contábil)",
      "workspace": "sucont",
      "path": "apps/sucont",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_SUCONT_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_SUCONT_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "healthUrlVar": "SUCONT_HEALTH_URL",
      "buildArgFrom": {
        "VITE_SUCONT_SUPABASE_URL": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_URL",
        "VITE_SUCONT_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "assignment-selection",
      "title": "ASSIGNMENT-SELECTION (escolha de vagas / CPAINT)",
      "workspace": "@iefa/assignment-selection",
      "path": "apps/assignment-selection",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_ASSIGNMENT_SELECTION_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_ASSIGNMENT_SELECTION_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "healthUrlVar": "ASSIGNMENT_SELECTION_HEALTH_URL",
      "buildArgFrom": {
        "VITE_ASSIGNMENT_SELECTION_SUPABASE_URL": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_URL",
        "VITE_ASSIGNMENT_SELECTION_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY": "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "sisub",
      "title": "SISUB",
      "workspace": "@iefa/sisub",
      "path": "apps/sisub",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_SISUB_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY", "VITE_FARO_COLLECTOR_URL", "VITE_FARO_APP_NAME", "VITE_FARO_ENVIRONMENT"],
      "buildSecrets": ["FARO_SOURCEMAP_API_KEY"],
      "buildArgComments": {
        "VITE_FARO_COLLECTOR_URL": "Observability — Faro frontend (baked no bundle do cliente em build-time).\nVazio → faro.client.ts vira no-op silencioso. Não persiste na imagem runtime\n(o estágio de runtime é um FROM separado, não herda estes ARG)."
      },
      "buildSecretComments": {
        "FARO_SOURCEMAP_API_KEY": "Faro sourcemap upload — secret do BuildKit, montado como env SÓ neste RUN e lido pelo\nvite.config.ts (loadEnv). Ausente → build não gera/envia maps. Não fica em ARG,\ncamada, cache nem na imagem runtime."
      },
      "healthUrlVar": "SISUB_HEALTH_URL",
      "check": ["@iefa/sisub#lint", "@iefa/sisub#typecheck", "@iefa/sisub#test:unit", "@iefa/pbac#test", "@iefa/sisub-domain#test"],
      "optionalBuildArgs": ["VITE_FARO_COLLECTOR_URL", "VITE_FARO_APP_NAME", "VITE_FARO_ENVIRONMENT"]
    },
    {
      "key": "forms",
      "title": "FORMS",
      "workspace": "@iefa/forms",
      "path": "apps/forms",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "buildArgDefaults": {
        "VITE_APP_TENANT": "forms"
      },
      "healthUrlVar": "FORMS_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "contrate",
      "title": "CONTRATE (copiloto de aquisições — Projeto α)",
      "workspace": "@iefa/contrate",
      "path": "apps/contrate",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3000,
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "healthUrlVar": "CONTRATE_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "alpha",
      "title": "Projeto α (apps/alpha) — Hono + LangGraph + Bun",
      "workspace": "@iefa/alpha",
      "path": "apps/alpha",
      "kind": "bun-bundle",
      "port": 8000,
      "entry": "apps/alpha/dist/index.js",
      "buildArgs": [],
      "runtimeEnv": {
        "PORT": "8000"
      },
      "healthUrlVar": "ALPHA_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "docs",
      "title": "DOCS",
      "workspace": "@iefa/docs",
      "path": "apps/docs",
      "kind": "nitro",
      "port": 3003,
      "runtimeFrom": "base",
      "runtimeEnv": {
        "PORT": "3003"
      },
      "outputAt": "apps/docs/.output",
      "buildArgs": [],
      "check": ["@iefa/docs#lint", "@iefa/docs#typecheck"],
      "release": "static-site"
    },
    {
      "key": "sisub-mcp",
      "filterKey": "mcp",
      "title": "SISUB-MCP — MCP server (bun runtime, HTTP transport)",
      "workspace": "@iefa/sisub-mcp",
      "path": "apps/sisub-mcp",
      "kind": "bun-bundle",
      "port": 3000,
      "entry": "apps/sisub-mcp/dist/index.js",
      "buildArgs": [],
      "runtimeEnv": {
        "MCP_TRANSPORT": "http",
        "MCP_PORT": "3000"
      },
      "healthUrlVar": "MCP_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "5s",
      "title": "5S — mesmo build do forms, com o tenant trocado",
      "aliasOf": "forms",
      "path": "apps/forms",
      "buildArgs": ["VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_URL", "VITE_IEFA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY"],
      "buildArgDefaults": {
        "VITE_APP_TENANT": "cinco-s"
      },
      "healthUrlVar": "FORMS_5S_HEALTH_URL"
    },
    {
      "key": "pdf",
      "title": "PDF — BentoPDF (ferramentas de PDF que rodam no navegador)",
      "path": "apps/pdf",
      "kind": "dockerfile",
      "port": 8080,
      "buildArgs": [],
      "notes": "Upstream do BentoPDF (AGPL-3.0) sem modificação, em versão fixada, montado por apps/pdf/Dockerfile. Não é workspace Bun.",
      "healthUrlVar": "PDF_HEALTH_URL",
      "buildTimeoutMinutes": 40,
      "bakeAttemptTimeoutMinutes": 25
    }
  ]
}
